# 🌿 HerbHacks — AI-Based Herbal Skin Care Solution
### Project Report | March 2026

---

## 1. Executive Summary

**HerbHacks** is a full-stack AI-powered web application that helps users understand their skin health and discover herbal remedies. The system uses a custom-trained deep learning model to classify skin types from photos, scans cosmetic product labels for harmful chemicals via OCR, and recommends herbal treatments. It was built for the **CVMU Hackathon 4.0**.

---

## 2. Architecture Overview

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[React Frontend<br/>Vite + Tailwind] -->|HTTP / Axios| B[FastAPI Backend<br/>Python 3]
    B --> C[MobileNetV2 Model<br/>skin_model.h5]
    B --> D[Tesseract OCR<br/>Ingredient Scanner]
    B --> E[Supabase Cloud<br/>Auth + DB + Storage]
    B --> F[SQLite Local DB<br/>herbhacks.db]
    A --> E
```

