## 4. Machine Learning Model

### Architecture
- **Base Model:** MobileNetV2 (pre-trained on ImageNet, weights frozen)
- **Custom Head:**
  - `GlobalAveragePooling2D`
  - `Dense(128, relu)`
  - `Dropout(0.3)`
  - `Dense(3, softmax)` — final output layer
- **Model file:** [backend/skin_model.h5](file:///c:/Users/savan/Desktop/herbal/backend/skin_model.h5) (~11.5 MB)

### Training Configuration
| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Input Size | 224 × 224 × 3 |
| Batch Size | 32 |
| Max Epochs | 15 |
| Optimizer | Adam |
| Loss | Categorical Cross-Entropy |
| Early Stopping | patience=3 (monitors `val_loss`) |
| Best Checkpoint | Saves on best `val_accuracy` |

### Data Augmentation
- Rotation ±20°, Width/Height shift ±20%, Shear ±20%, Zoom ±20%
- Horizontal flip, nearest fill mode

### Output Classes
| Class | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `acne` | Acne-prone skin |
| `normal` | Balanced/healthy skin |
| `oily` | Oily/sebaceous skin |

### Skin Health Score Formula
```
health_score = (normal_prob × 100) + (oily_prob × 40) + (acne_prob × 20)
               Clamped between 10 – 100
```

---

## 5. API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Auth | Description |
|--------|----------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/` | None | Health check |
| POST | `/auth/register` | None | Register user (local DB) |
| POST | `/auth/login` | None | Login → JWT token |
| GET | `/auth/me` | Bearer JWT | Get current user |
| POST | `/predict` | Optional | Upload image file → skin analysis |
| POST | `/predict-frame` | Optional | Base64 webcam frame → skin analysis |
| POST | `/analyze` | Supabase JWT | Analyze from URL (Supabase) |
| POST | `/scan-ingredients` | None | Upload product label → OCR analysis |
| GET | `/harmful-chemicals` | None | List all harmful chemicals DB |

---

## 6. Core Features

### 🔬 AI Skin Analysis (Scan Page)
- Upload a photo **or** use live webcam (MediaPipe face detection)
- Runs through MobileNetV2 classifier
- Returns: skin type, confidence %, class probabilities, skin health score
- Provides herbal **remedies**, **description**, and **care tips** from `remedies.json`
- **Safeguard:** OCR pre-check on uploaded image — if product label text is detected (2+ trigger words), rejects image and redirects to Ingredient Scanner

### 🧪 Ingredient Scanner
- Upload a cosmetic product label photo
- OpenCV pre-processing → Tesseract OCR → extract raw text
- Cross-references against `harmful_chemicals.json` database
- Returns list of harmful chemicals detected with warnings

### 📊 Dashboard
- User scan history (fetched from Supabase `scan_history` table)
- Charts and analytics via Recharts

### 🗺️ Nearby Stores
- Uses browser Geolocation API
- Interactive map (Leaflet) showing nearby herbal / ayurvedic / organic stores
- Store details and "Get Directions" integration

### 🔐 Authentication
- **Dual auth system:**
  - Local: SQLAlchemy + SQLite (register/login with bcrypt hashed passwords, HS256 JWT)
  - Cloud: Supabase JWT for protected `/analyze` endpoint
- `ProtectedRoute` component guards all sensitive pages

### ☁️ Cloud Persistence (Supabase)
- Scan images uploaded to **Supabase Storage** bucket (`scan-images`)
- Scan results saved to `scan_history` table (user_id, image_url, disease_name, confidence_score, remedies)
- Runs as a **background task** so it never blocks the API response

